WEBVTT

00:00:15.394 --> 00:00:16.520
A great waterfall.

00:00:16.604 --> 00:00:17.730
At the end of the world.

00:00:18.356 --> 00:00:20.858
-[Stormfly snarls]
-[both scream]

00:00:20.942 --> 00:00:22.193
[Astrid echoing] Stormfly!

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.718
[sniffing]

00:00:48.552 --> 00:00:49.512
[grunts]

00:01:18.499 --> 00:01:20.167
[chuckles] Wow.

00:01:20.918 --> 00:01:22.128
Look.

00:01:50.448 --> 00:01:52.325
[wings fluttering]

00:01:53.576 --> 00:01:55.953
[both gasping softly]

00:01:56.871 --> 00:01:58.706
[both] Wow.

00:02:12.553 --> 00:02:13.596
[gasps]

00:02:25.149 --> 00:02:27.026
[dragons calling]

00:02:38.662 --> 00:02:40.623
It really does exist.

00:02:41.207 --> 00:02:43.376
[dragons calling]

00:02:58.516 --> 00:02:59.517
Toothless.

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.185
Shh. You'll spook them.

00:03:11.987 --> 00:03:13.364
[dragons roaring]

00:03:17.243 --> 00:03:18.285
[roars]

00:03:31.257 --> 00:03:33.426
[dragons roaring loudly]

00:03:39.723 --> 00:03:41.058
[roaring loudly]

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.896
Now that's a king.

00:03:52.945 --> 00:03:54.405
[purrs softly]

00:04:01.412 --> 00:04:03.456
[both calling softly]

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.626
[coos]

